    "source_delta_summary": "Both launch snapshots share the same base revision and match in native argv after normalizing run-output/movie paths and removing the declared --resting-bed-surface option. Their retained source patches differ in the contoured-bed mesh shading tangent construction (attempt002 contains the orthonormal tangent fix) and line-offset metadata. The native executable hashes differ; loaded MetalRobo dylib and shader-library pins match. The contoured invocation adds the bed manifest and --resting-bed-surface; the failure-receipt environment value also points to each run own output directory.",
    "source_patch_diff_excerpt": [
      "--- \n",
      "+++ \n",
      "@@ -232 +232 @@\n",
      "-index f200376..b98db23 100644",
      "+index f200376..f744543 100644",
      "@@ -265 +265 @@\n",
      "-@@ -1577,20 +1582,57 @@ public:",
      "+@@ -1577,20 +1582,66 @@ public:",
      "@@ -293 +293,10 @@\n",
      "-+                pack.vertices[i].normalAndTangentSign={n.x/norm,n.y/norm,n.z/norm,1};",
      "++                const mr_float4 unit{n.x/norm,n.y/norm,n.z/norm,0};",
      "++                pack.vertices[i].normalAndTangentSign={unit.x,unit.y,unit.z,1};",
      "++                const mr_float4 reference=std::abs(unit.x)<.8f",
      "++                    ?mr_float4{1,0,0,0}:mr_float4{0,1,0,0};",
      "++                const auto tangent=subtractPoint(reference,scalePoint(unit,dotPoint(reference,unit)));",
      "++                const float tangentNorm=std::sqrt(dotPoint(tangent,tangent));",
      "++                require(tangentNorm>0&&std::isfinite(tangentNorm),",
      "++                    \"contoured bed has a degenerate shading tangent\");",
      "++                pack.vertices[i].tangent={tangent.x/tangentNorm,",
      "++                    tangent.y/tangentNorm,tangent.z/tangentNorm,0};"
    ],
    "source_patch_diff_stat_lines": 35
  },
